WEBVTT

00:02:58.216 --> 00:03:01.510
(Laughter)

00:03:01.552 --> 00:03:04.055
Yeah, alright, so we're dunking now.

00:03:04.055 --> 00:03:05.723
(Laughter)

00:03:05.765 --> 00:03:07.725
"Actually, you know what?

00:03:07.725 --> 00:03:11.646
Call me when women can do 360 dunks."

00:03:13.231 --> 00:03:15.191
2050 here, on the line.

00:03:15.233 --> 00:03:18.945
“Yeah, alright.
We’re doing 360 dunks now too.

00:03:19.820 --> 00:03:23.282
Ah, yeah, alright. We’ll call you, then.”

00:03:23.699 --> 00:03:24.825
You get it.

00:03:25.868 --> 00:03:28.246
So let me lay out my theory for you.

00:03:28.955 --> 00:03:33.000
My theory about what actually
compels us to watch sports.